# Local IPOs: finding a company that has just gone public. Its stock is the first card of
# Purchasable Investments; the dialog's View headquarters opens the building's own info panel
# with the camera near enough to see it whole; and fireworks go off over the building once the
# game runs again. Everything listed is removed in cleanup.
name local ipos: a new company leads the list; View opens its building with fireworks
local-ipos on
ipo-healthy-days 1
ipo-scan
ipo-dialog on
ipo-list-now
wait 1
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulIpoDialog
ipo-view
wait 1
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulIpoDialog
expect-building-panel
expect-log ipo dialog: showing headquarters building
pause off
wait 3
expect-fireworks
expect-log ipo fireworks: over building
capture ipo-headquarters
show-economy
wait 1.5
expect-company-first
# its icon is a coin with the icon of its kind of business, like the game's stocks (not the
# stack of money)
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulCoinGlyph
capture ipo-company-first
cleanup:
close-economy
ipo-dialog close
ipo-remove-test
local-ipos restore
